(MUNICIPAL CORPORATION — Tender EE/MM/83/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This specification covers construction of pump house with structural steel roof and electrical) Tj T*
(works complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(\(a\) Exposure condition shall be considered as severe for all members.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — CONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT) Tj T*
(\(a\) Design and construction of RCC shall be in accordance with IS 456:2000.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Grade of concrete for all structural members shall be M 30.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Clear cover to main reinforcement shall be 45 MM for all members.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Maximum free water cement ratio shall be 0.45.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Cement content shall not be less than 320 Kg/cum of concrete.) Tj T*
(\(f\) OPC 43 GRADE CEMENT AS PER IS 8112 SHALL BE USED.) Tj T*
(\(g\) AGGREGATES SHALL COMPLY WITH THE REQUIREMENTS OF IS 383:2016.) Tj T*
(\(h\) High strength deformed bars of grade Fe 500D as per IS 1786:2008 shall be used. Mix design) Tj T*
(shall be carried out in accordance with IS 10262:2019.) Tj T*
(\(i\) Concrete shall be kept continuously moist for at least 10 days.) Tj T*
(\(j\) Compaction shall be done by immersion vibrators.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART E — STRUCTURAL STEEL WORK) Tj T*
(\(a\) Rolled steel sections shall be E250 grade as per IS 2062:2011.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Steel surfaces shall be painted with red oxide primer and two finishing coats.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Welding shall be done by qualified welders using approved electrodes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(\(a\) The internal wiring installation shall comply with IS 732:2019. EARTHING ARRANGEMENT OF THE) Tj T*
(INSTALLATION SHALL BE TN-S SYSTEM.) Tj T*
(\(b\) All wiring shall be drawn through heavy gauge PVC conduits recessed in walls.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
ET
