(MUNICIPAL CORPORATION — Tender EE/MM/83/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(\(c\) Building wires shall be 450/750 V grade PVC insulated multistrand copper conductor as per) Tj T*
(IS 694:2010.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Minimum conductor size shall be 1.5 sq mm for lighting points and 4 sq mm for power points.) Tj T*
(\(e\) MCBs shall be C-curve, as per IS/IEC 60898-1, with rated short circuit capacity of 10kA.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Final circuit MCBs shall be rated between 6 Amp and 32 Amp.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Socket outlet circuits shall be protected by 30 mA RCCBs conforming to IS 12640 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(\(h\) The earthing system shall be designed and installed as per IS 3043:2018.) Tj T*
(\(i\) Main distribution board shall be earthed through two separate pipe earth electrodes.) Tj T*
(Combined resistance of the earthing system shall be less than 1 Ohm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 7: TESTING, INSPECTION AND CERTIFICATION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Cube tests for compressive strength shall be done in accordance with IS 516 \(Part 1/Sec) Tj T*
(1\):2021.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Mill test certificates for steel and test certificates for cement shall be submitted for) Tj T*
(every consignment.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Structural steel shall be accompanied by mill test certificates from the producer.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Tests shall be carried out on completion of the installation as per IS 732 and results) Tj T*
(recorded. ALL WIRES, MCBS AND RCCBS SHALL BEAR THE BIS STANDARD MARK.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Pre-dispatch inspection shall be offered to the Department's authorised representative with) Tj T*
(15 days notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(\(a\) Shop drawings and schematic diagrams shall be got approved from the Engineer-in-charge) Tj T*
(before manufacture. O&M manuals, as-built drawings and catalogues shall be furnished in) Tj T*
(triplicate at the time of handing over.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The supplier shall replace free of cost any part found defective within the defect) Tj T*
(liability period of 24 months.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Training of two operators for one week shall be imparted by the supplier after) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
